# 统一以 LF 入库：避免 Windows 检出时 CRLF、Linux/macOS 检出时 LF 造成的无意义 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.p12 binary
*.cer binary
*.p7b binary
*.hap binary
*.har binary
*.so binary
*.jar binary

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则某些解析器会出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
